WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.814 --> 00:00:10.781
&gt;&gt; MIKE: BATTLES, TARGETING A

00:00:10.782 --> 00:00:12.316
PIZZA CRIME FOR PAINTING AN

00:00:12.317 --> 00:00:14.051
AMERICAN FLAG MURAL.

00:00:14.052 --> 00:00:19.824
LAURA SPOKE EARLIER WITH THE

00:00:19.825 --> 00:00:21.459
BISTRO OWNER, WHO ORGANIZED A

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.327
PARADE TO SUPPORT THE FLAG.

00:00:23.328 --> 00:00:24.262
LET'S WATCH.

00:00:24.263 --> 00:00:25.296
&gt;&gt; LAURA: BEFORE YOU HAD THIS

00:00:25.297 --> 00:00:26.898
MURAL PAINTED, I GUESS IT WAS AN

00:00:26.899 --> 00:00:28.733
OLD WALL AND YOU WANTED TO

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:30.735
SPRUCE IT UP, YOU HAD SOME

00:00:30.736 --> 00:00:32.503
PROBLEMS, I UNDERSTAND, WITH

00:00:32.504 --> 00:00:33.871
PROTESTORS, AND FOR PEOPLE WHO

00:00:33.872 --> 00:00:35.206
DON'T KNOW WHERE THIS IS, THIS

00:00:35.207 --> 00:00:39.444
IS IN NEW PALTZ, NEW YORK, 80

00:00:39.445 --> 00:00:41.312
MILES NORTH OF NEW YORK CITY,

00:00:41.313 --> 00:00:47.185
AND IT'S 14,000, 12,000 PEOPLE.

00:00:47.186 --> 00:00:50.488
WHAT WAS THEIR BEEF ABOUT THE

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:50.788
FLAG?

00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:55.226
&gt;&gt; WELL, THEY DIDN'T WANT A

00:00:55.227 --> 00:00:55.626
FLAG.

00:00:55.627 --> 00:00:58.496
THEY THOUGHT IT MEANT A

00:00:58.497 --> 00:01:01.165
POLITICAL POSITION, AND THEY

00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:02.934
WERE OPPOSED.

00:01:02.935 --> 00:01:03.901
&gt;&gt; LAURA: WHAT POLITICAL PASSION

00:01:03.902 --> 00:01:05.703
IS A FLAG OTHER THAN THIS IS THE

00:01:05.704 --> 00:01:06.537
UNITED STATES OF AMERICA?

00:01:06.538 --> 00:01:08.706
DID YOU ENGAGE IN ANY

00:01:08.707 --> 00:01:11.008
CONVERSATIONS WITH THEM?

00:01:11.009 --> 00:01:12.510
&gt;&gt; NO, I DIDN'T.

00:01:12.511 --> 00:01:14.445
I REALLY DIDN'T INTERACT WITH

00:01:14.446 --> 00:01:17.849
THEM AT ALL.

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:19.350
I JUST OBSERVED.

00:01:19.351 --> 00:01:21.486
&gt;&gt; LAURA: WERE THEY STANDING

00:01:21.487 --> 00:01:21.819
OUTSIDE?

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.688
WERE THEY COMING IN AND

00:01:23.689 --> 00:01:24.989
EXPRESSING THEMSELVES VERBALLY

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:26.357
TO YOU SAYING, I'M NOT GOING TO

00:01:26.358 --> 00:01:29.193
EVER ORDER ONE OF YOUR PIZZAS OR

00:01:29.194 --> 00:01:30.595
GRINDERS, OR WHAT?

00:01:30.596 --> 00:01:32.063
&gt;&gt; I DID HAVE A FEW PEOPLE COME

00:01:32.064 --> 00:01:35.366
IN AND SAY THEY COULDN'T SUPPORT

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.001
MY STORE ANY LONGER BECAUSE THEY

00:01:37.002 --> 00:01:38.936
FELT I TOOK A POLITICAL

00:01:38.937 --> 00:01:39.937
POSITION, SO THEY COULDN'T SPEND

00:01:39.938 --> 00:01:41.506
THEIR MONEY.

00:01:41.507 --> 00:01:43.441
&gt;&gt; LAURA: WAIT A SECOND.

00:01:43.442 --> 00:01:43.741
OKAY.

00:01:43.742 --> 00:01:45.376
ARE THESE COLLEGE KID BECAUSE I

00:01:45.377 --> 00:01:48.546
KNOW YOU'VE GOT A COLLEGE -- A

00:01:48.547 --> 00:01:50.515
STATE UNIVERSITY, IN NEW PALTZ

00:01:50.516 --> 00:01:51.149
IN TOWN.

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:51.983
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:01:51.984 --> 00:01:53.184
&gt;&gt; LAURA: WERE THEY COLLEGE

00:01:53.185 --> 00:01:53.484
KIDS?

00:01:53.485 --> 00:01:55.153
&gt;&gt; NO, IN PARTICULAR, THAT WAS

00:01:55.154 --> 00:01:56.487
NOT A COLLEGE KID THAT CAME IN

00:01:56.488 --> 00:01:58.589
AND TOLD ME THAT.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.625
&gt;&gt; LAURA: THAT'S A RELIEF THAT

00:02:00.626 --> 00:02:01.826
HAPPENED, AND THEN FAST FORWARD

00:02:01.827 --> 00:02:03.294
TO THE PAINT SPLATTERED ALL OVER

00:02:03.295 --> 00:02:04.061
THE MURAL.

00:02:04.062 --> 00:02:05.763
PEOPLE ACROSS THE COUNTRY ARE

00:02:05.764 --> 00:02:07.498
WONDERING, WHY ARE WE FOCUSED ON

00:02:07.499 --> 00:02:09.300
THIS SMALL TOWN IN NEW YORK AND

00:02:09.301 --> 00:02:11.068
THIS ONE MURAL IN THIS ONE

00:02:11.069 --> 00:02:12.670
DEFACING OF A MURAL.

00:02:12.671 --> 00:02:14.305
WE'RE FOCUSING ON IT BECAUSE

00:02:14.306 --> 00:02:15.239
IT'S OUR FLAG.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.241
AND IT REPRESENTS A LOT.

00:02:17.242 --> 00:02:18.276
JOEY, YOU'RE A VETERAN.

00:02:18.277 --> 00:02:20.044
YOU SAW THAT THIS HAD HAPPENED

00:02:20.045 --> 00:02:21.946
THE IN YOUR HOMETOWN.

00:02:21.947 --> 00:02:25.917
YOU DECIDED TO DO WHAT AND WHY?

00:02:25.918 --> 00:02:27.852
&gt;&gt; WHEN I SAW THE PUSH BACK SHE

00:02:27.853 --> 00:02:29.387
WAS GETTING FOR PUTTING AN

00:02:29.388 --> 00:02:30.555
AMERICAN FLAG MURAL UP I

00:02:30.556 --> 00:02:31.823
PERSONALLY HAD A PROBLEM WITH

00:02:31.824 --> 00:02:33.558
THAT SO I HAD THE IDEA, WHY

00:02:33.559 --> 00:02:35.493
DON'T WOVE AN EVENT WHERE WE ALL

00:02:35.494 --> 00:02:36.861
JUST COME TOGETHER IN SUPPORT OF

00:02:36.862 --> 00:02:38.529
THE FLAG AND IN SUPPORT OF THE

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:39.931
MURAL AND SHOW OUR SUPPORT.

00:02:39.932 --> 00:02:41.165
AND IT WASN'T SURE HOW IT WAS

00:02:41.166 --> 00:02:42.567
GOING TO GO, WHAT KIND OF

00:02:42.568 --> 00:02:43.801
TURNOUT WE WOULD GET.

00:02:43.802 --> 00:02:45.736
WE $UP HAVING LIKE 400 OR 500

00:02:45.737 --> 00:02:46.637
PEOPLE TO COME OUT.

00:02:46.638 --> 00:02:47.672
IT WAS AMAZING.

00:02:47.673 --> 00:02:49.040
WE ALL HAD OUR FLAGS.

00:02:49.041 --> 00:02:49.907
WE SHOWED OUR SUPPORT.

00:02:49.908 --> 00:02:52.109
IT WAS A GREAT, POSITIVE,

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:52.743
PEACEFUL DAY.

00:02:52.744 --> 00:02:54.846
&gt;&gt; LAURA: JOEY, DID YOU HAVE A

00:02:54.847 --> 00:02:58.883
CHANCE TO SPEAK TO ANY OF THESE

00:02:58.884 --> 00:03:00.952
BRAVE PROTESTORS WHO WERE

00:03:00.953 --> 00:03:02.053
AGAINST THIS MURAL?

00:03:02.054 --> 00:03:04.488
DID YOU EVER ENGAGE IN ANY

00:03:04.489 --> 00:03:06.591
MEANINGFUL DIALOGUE WITH ANY OF

00:03:06.592 --> 00:03:06.891
THEM?

00:03:06.892 --> 00:03:07.525
&gt;&gt; I TRIED.

00:03:07.526 --> 00:03:08.960
THERE WAS NOT MUCH MEANINGFUL

00:03:08.961 --> 00:03:10.761
DIALOGUE TO BE HAD WITH MOST OF

00:03:10.762 --> 00:03:11.062
THEM.

00:03:11.063 --> 00:03:13.331
THE DAY OF THE EVENT, WE HAD

00:03:13.332 --> 00:03:14.398
SOME OF THEM SHOW UP.

00:03:14.399 --> 00:03:16.300
I TRIED TO TALK TO THEM, YOU

00:03:16.301 --> 00:03:17.602
KNOW, TRIED EXPLAIN, HEY, YOU

00:03:17.603 --> 00:03:19.337
GUYS HAVE THE RIGHT TO BE OUT

00:03:19.338 --> 00:03:21.272
HERE, SO DO WE, LET'S KEEP IT

00:03:21.273 --> 00:03:21.639
PEACEFUL.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.708
THEY DIDN'T WANT TO HEAR ANY OF

00:03:23.709 --> 00:03:24.709
THAT I WAS LABELED MANY

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.310
DIFFERENT NAMES BY PEOPLE, YOU

00:03:26.311 --> 00:03:27.678
KNOW, FROM THESE PROTESTORS.

00:03:27.679 --> 00:03:30.481
SOME PEOPLE IN THE COMMUNITY FOR

00:03:30.482 --> 00:03:31.616
PUTTING THIS TOGETHER BUT IT WAS

00:03:31.617 --> 00:03:33.417
JUST ABOUT SUPPORTING OUR FLAG,

00:03:33.418 --> 00:03:35.019
MILITARY AND LAW ENFORCEMENT.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.255
&gt;&gt; LAURA: JOEY, DOES IT SEEM

00:03:37.256 --> 00:03:38.923
LIKE THESE PROTESTORS, JUST FROM

00:03:38.924 --> 00:03:40.758
THE WAY THEY APPEARED, IT'S AN

00:03:40.759 --> 00:03:41.792
AGGRESSIVE -- I DON'T KNOW IF

00:03:41.793 --> 00:03:44.595
IT'S A PROTEST, IT AN AGGRESSIVE

00:03:44.596 --> 00:03:45.263
INTIMIDATION CAMPAIGN.

00:03:45.264 --> 00:03:47.031
THEY ARE TRYING TO INTIMIDATE

00:03:47.032 --> 00:03:48.599
MARIA TO PUT SOMETHING ELSE UP

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.301
THERE, TO FRIGHTEN HER.

00:03:50.302 --> 00:03:52.703
THAT'S WHY THEY HAVE LIKE, YOU

00:03:52.704 --> 00:03:54.405
KNOW, BLACK FLAGS, IT LOOKS MORE

00:03:54.406 --> 00:03:56.641
LIKE ISIS THAN ANY TYPE OF

00:03:56.642 --> 00:03:58.142
PEACEFUL PROTESTS THAT I WAS

00:03:58.143 --> 00:03:59.644
USED TO SEEING GROWING UP.

00:03:59.645 --> 00:04:01.913
THEIR GOAL IS TO DO WHAT,

00:04:01.914 --> 00:04:02.280
REALLY?

00:04:02.281 --> 00:04:03.714
TO HAVE MORE DIALOGUE OR TO SHUT

00:04:03.715 --> 00:04:04.248
IT DOWN?

00:04:04.249 --> 00:04:05.583
&gt;&gt; TO SHUT IT DOWN.

00:04:05.584 --> 00:04:07.051
THEY DISAGREE WITH IT SO THEY

00:04:07.052 --> 00:04:08.653
WOULD RATHER IT JUST GO AWAY AND

00:04:08.654 --> 00:04:11.222
NOT BE THERE, AND THEY DIDN'T

00:04:11.223 --> 00:04:12.724
WANT US TO BE OUT THERE THAT

00:04:12.725 --> 00:04:14.225
DAY, LIKE I SAID, WE HAVE HAD

00:04:14.226 --> 00:04:16.561
400 OR 500 OF US, LIKE 20 OF

00:04:16.562 --> 00:04:16.995
THEM.

00:04:16.996 --> 00:04:17.829
&gt;&gt; LAURA: THAT'S GREAT.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.097
&gt;&gt; WE JUST DID OUR THING.

00:04:19.098 --> 00:04:20.632
OUR CHANTS FOR USA, THEIR

00:04:20.633 --> 00:04:23.668
CHANTS, YOU CAN'T SAY ON TV.

00:04:23.669 --> 00:04:24.469
&gt;&gt; LAURA: LOVELY.

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:26.137
UNITY AND DIVERSITY DAY, BY THE

00:04:26.138 --> 00:04:28.473
WAY, IS SOMETHING THAT'S BEEN

00:04:28.474 --> 00:04:31.175
CELEBRATED IN NEW PALTZ, NEW

00:04:31.176 --> 00:04:33.011
YORK, UNITY AND DIVERSITY DAY.

00:04:33.012 --> 00:04:34.479
HOW ABOUT A LITTLE UNITY BEHIND

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.114
OUR NATION AND THE IDEA OF

00:04:36.115 --> 00:04:37.048
LIBERTY AND FREEDOM.

00:04:37.049 --> 00:04:37.882
&gt;&gt; EXACTLY.

00:04:37.883 --> 00:04:39.050
&gt;&gt; LAURA: GUYS, THANK YOU SO

00:04:39.051 --> 00:04:40.051
MUCH FOR JOINING US TONIGHT.

00:04:40.052 --> 00:04:43.522
WE REALLY, REALLY APPRECIATE IT,

